  {
    "id": "glicko_cs",
    "name": "Glicko with correlated surface skills",
    "family": "new rating",
    "description": "A skill per surface, correlated (the Bayesian form of the surface blend), updated match by match by Glicko's (Kalman) step; the deviation grows with the time since the player's last match",
